{"3380760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "2024: Mosaic Retrospective", "steam_appid": 3380760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <i>2024: Mosaic Retrospective</i> is <strong>digital cross-stitch</strong>. A meditative game about completing a single <strong>enormous</strong> 60,000 piece grid puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖼️ In this entry<i> </i>in the <i>Mega Mosaic</i> series, you'll slowly reveal a pixel art collage of major news events from the last year, ranging from politics to sport, climate change to pop culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💣 If you’re familiar with minesweeper, you’re ready to dive in! Use the numbered clues (0-9) to uncover light tiles that gradually reveal an intricate, detailed mosaic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 Whether you're engrossed in your favourite podcasts or listening to your favourite tunes, 2024: Mosaic Retrospective serves as the perfect backdrop to enhance your experience. Or choose from the soothing built-in  soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏳ Dozens of Hours of Addictive Gameplay! <i>2024: Mosaic Retrospective</i> offers hours of meditative, yet challenging gameplay as you piece together the events that shaped the year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380760/extras/dd6436e783a1416f418a98a05a05a0d8.avif?t=1760618110\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380760/extras_big/dd6436e783a1416f418a98a05a05a0d8.avif?t=1760618110 width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you like this free game, please consider supporting the UNICEF fundraiser that the game is supporting! You can find the link to the fundraiser in the settings menu within the game.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 